Note: query param might be stale when navigating from catalog; using snapshot in constructor is fine as component recreated. But if already on variantes page and user clicks "Variantes" from master, navigation changes query params on same component → constructor not rerun. Could subscribe to queryParamMap with takeUntilDestroyed. Let me do that for correctness:

```ts
this.ruta.queryParamMap.pipe(takeUntilDestroyed()).subscribe(params => {
  const id = params.get('producto');
  this.producto.set(id ?? 'TODOS');
});
```
Need `takeUntilDestroyed` import.

