content.text:
Now, another important detail: `this.fb.nonNullable.group({...}, { validators: seleccionesRequeridas })` — Angular 22's typed FormBuilder `group` accepts `validatorOrOpts` as `AbstractControlOptions | ValidatorFn | ValidatorFn[]`. Passing an object with `validators` key is correct.

Next potential issue: `getRawValue()` types. With `nonNullable`, `forma.getRawValue()` returns:
```
{
  nombre: string;
  categoriaId: number;
  descripcion: string;
  ...
  colores: boolean[];
  tallas: boolean[];
  imagenesPorColor: { BL: string; NG: string; GR: string };
}
```
Good.

`valores()` signal typed accordingly. `imagenesPorColor` assigned to `DatosProducto.imagenesPorColor: Partial<Record<CodigoColor,string>>` — `{BL:string;NG:string;GR:string}` assignable. Good.

Next: `catalogo-maestro.ts` uses `CurrencyPipe` imported but the template uses currency pipe — yes.

