content.text:
Need same consideration for other page-specific overrides. We'll use higher specificity or adjust styleUrls order. Could set styleUrls shared first then page CSS to ensure page-specific wins: `styleUrls: ['../../estilos-compartidos.css', './movimientos.css']`. We already wrote all pages with page first except existencias. Better to keep page first and use specificity. For existencias no overrides of shared selectors except new classes. Fine. For ajuste/reglas, need be careful.

Now ajuste page.

TS details. Need Validators, FormBuilder, ReactiveFormsModule. Need ModalConfirmacion, AvisosServicio, nav.

Potential issue: `FormBuilder.nonNullable.group` with `varianteId: [numero, [Validators.required]]` typed number. Good.

Define `validadorEntero` outside:
```ts
const entero: ValidatorFn = (control: AbstractControl): ValidationErrors | null =>
  control.value === null || control.value === '' || Number.isInteger(control.value) ? null : { entero: true };
```
Need `AbstractControl`, `ValidationErrors`, `ValidatorFn`, `Validators` imports.

Need `errorConteo` computed. Need `filaSeleccionada` computed. Need `diferencia` computed. Need `confirmando` signal. Need `intento` signal.

Need `guardar()` check `this.forma.invalid || this.errorConteo() !== null`. But `errorConteo` might be non-null when field empty; validators catch. Good.
Need if `diferencia() < 0` open modal; else `registrar()`.
Need `confirmar()` call `registrar()` and close.
Need `registrar()`:
```ts
private registrar(): void {
 const fila = this.filaSeleccionada();
 if (!fila) return;
 const resultado = this.servicio.registrarAjuste({...});
 this.avisos.mostrar(resultado.ok ? 'exito' : 'error', resultado.mensaje);
 if (resultado.ok) {
  this.forma.controls.motivo.reset('');
  const actualizada = this.servicio.filas().find(f=>f.varianteId===fila.varianteId);
  const cantidad = actualizada?.existencia ?? fila.existencia;
  this.forma.controls.cantidadContada.setValue(cantidad);
  this.conteo.set(cantidad);
  this.intento.set(false);
  this.forma.controls.cantidadContada.markAsUntouched();
  this.forma.controls.motivo.markAsUntouched();
 }
 this.confirmando.set(false);
}
```
Need `markAsPristine`? Not critical.

Need `esInvalido(campo)` method:
```ts
protected esInvalido(campo: 'cantidadContada'|'motivo'): boolean {
 const control = this.forma.controls[campo];
 return control.invalid && (control.touched || this.intento());
}
```
